{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是文化之日，放假。", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘爱理来了。’", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0372", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，这样啊……没注意到。”", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在我打扫房间的时候，濑名来找樱乃玩了。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名，今天没有打工吗……？”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过樱乃会找朋友来家里还真稀奇，濑名是第一个。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我还是窝在房间不要打扰她们比较好吧……", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不对，我应该出门比较好吗……？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "思考了几分钟后，我来到厨房准备茶水。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实我刚才已经换好外出服走到玄关了。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过认识的人来家里，不打声招呼也说不过去……好。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我记得家里有饼干，一起端过去好了……", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扰了……”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，我单手拿着托盘来到樱乃的房间。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我、我才是打扰了。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0728", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，谢谢。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0373", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么啦，毕竟是认识的人来家里……”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，我也好久没来樱乃的房间了。来濑名，请喝茶。”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“谢谢……你是说真的？”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0729", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接下我递出的杯子，濑名有点讶异地歪着头。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她穿着便服。这副打扮，除了初次见面以外还是第一次看到。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "依然是俐落谨慎的感觉。完全看不出她在自己家里会穿运动服和棉袍。", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我以为你们在家里也很融洽……”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0730", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“基本上是来我房间，对吧樱乃？”", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0374", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "同样接过茶的樱乃，像平常一样文静地点了点头。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“对了，你的书忘在我房间里了喔。我等一下拿过来。”", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不用。我没有忘记。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0375", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“后续的内容，我还会去哥哥房间看。”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0376", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，嗯嗯，原来如此。”", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就是这样。我对濑名耸了耸肩。", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……在学校和家里都是这样啊。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0731", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，说的也是。”", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0732", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理解了之后，濑名微笑着点点头。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她稍微举高杯子。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我就喝囉，瓜生。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0733", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，趁热喝吧。我就先走了，你们慢慢聊……”", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，等一下。”", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0734", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我本来想立刻就离开，但她却叫住我。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个……瓜、瓜生等一下有什么预定吗？”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0735", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？没什么特别的预定啊……”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“既然如此，反正机会难得，你多待一会吧？只端茶来就走，太冷淡了吧？”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0736", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……唉。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃，可以吗？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0737", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0377", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那哥哥的茶我去泡吧。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0378", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“麻烦你了。坐下吧，瓜生。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0738", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然不是很懂这个发展……", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那你可以坐过去一点吗，濑名？”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我又没有叫你坐我旁边！”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0739", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天的濑名也是立刻就对我的玩笑精准反击。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，拒绝恐怕会弄僵气氛，于是我就留下来陪她们喝茶了。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然不是坐在濑名旁边。", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是说，我没想到走到樱乃的家要花这么多时间。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0740", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为去久米超市的路已经走习惯了，我以为距离超市只要５分钟路程，应该没问题的……”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0741", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“到习惯为止，认路是一场战斗。”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0379", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的呢……只要习惯就好了，不过在那之前是个问题。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0742", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名对于第一次来的地方果然是迷路了啊……我一边猜想一边喝茶。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我只是陪喝茶的，所以很安分地在一旁默默听着。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0380", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯？”", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "此时，樱乃把话题抛给我。", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“教我们不会迷路的诀窍。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0381", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "居然问这么难的问题啊，妹妹。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“说得也是，我也想知道呢，‘哥哥’。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0743", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“常常听人家说男人与女人的大脑本质不同──对吧，樱乃？”", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0744", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0382", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是那样，这两个人的迷路本事也过于惊人了。", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，这个嘛……嗯～”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算不认识路，只要知道方位……呃，大概就明白了吧？”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“能明白的话就不用这么辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0745", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“前方是北方。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0383", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“未免太不明白了吧！”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0746", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“上面是北方才对。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0747", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0384", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我懂方位，但我完全不懂这两个人说的话……", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个濑名，从久米超市到我家，你是怎么来的？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃传了报路的邮件给我。”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0748", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0385", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我看看……？”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是传了有沿路指示的地图吗……我一边猜一边看向她递出的手机。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘久米超市出来后往斜前方走。香烟店前的红绿灯过马路后往右。遇到红色屋顶的住宅往左转──’", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0386", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我照邮件上说的，在香烟店前的红绿灯过马路后转弯了，可是……”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0749", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理大概是在有很多自动贩卖机的地方转弯了。”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0387", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“骗人！？那里不是香烟店吗？”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0750", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那个啊，今后你要去没去过的地方时，或许先在网络上查一下街景比较好……”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我家没有电脑……为了这个要去一趟学校也太累人了。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0751", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，就算看了，不实际去一趟也不知道。”", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0388", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“的确……不知道呢。在走到出现‘就是那条路！’的感觉为止，实在搞不清楚方向……”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0752", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0389", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于脑中就自带地图的我来说，此时的气氛就好像被排挤一样……", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是说……嗯。她们聊迷路聊得这么起劲，我差不多该退场比较好吧？", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我差不多该……”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当我站起来的时候。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0753", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被瞪了一眼所以又坐下了。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然又坐下了……但我才想问，为什么啊？", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不过樱乃有‘哥哥’会来找你，所以很安心吧。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0754", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0390", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果又有什么事，就麻烦了。”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0391", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这当然没问题，可是……”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呵呵。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0755", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──那之后。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我差不多该出去了。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "（盯。）", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0756", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……樱乃，我重新泡茶来吧？”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们慢慢聊。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瞪。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 2, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0757", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥，你一下站一下坐好忙。”", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0392", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么，今天打扰了。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0758", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果，我直到最后都在陪她们聊天。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理，掰掰。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0393", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，我会再来的。”", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0759", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生明天见。”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 374, "voice": "ar0760", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名看着并肩而站目送她的我和樱乃，不知道为什么好像很心满意足的样子。", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……因为我跟樱乃感情很好吗？", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“葛格？”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0394", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，没什么。”", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我只是在想该不该送她回去。濑名还不习惯这附近的路吧？”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“她说今天有把时间空下来了，会边迷路边记路。”", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 370, "voice": "sk0395", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……设想得真是周到。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 367, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_02.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她今天是特地来看“我们”的吗……", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
